---
import Frontispiece from "./Frontispiece.astro";
import plate from "../data/lasilla-plate.json";
---
          <!-- ───────────────────────────────────────── [05] Code -->
          <section class="surfaces" id="repositories" aria-labelledby="repositories-title">
            <div class="head head--plate head--plate-left">
              <div class="head__main">
                <p class="tag">[05] Code</p>
                <h2 id="repositories-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Read and edit the code your agents change.</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="body head__aside" data-reveal>
                Projects is the app’s section for your code. Open the copy an agent works in, read and edit
                its files with language servers behind them, and see how the code connects on the code
                graph. It has a tab on your iPhone too.
              </p>
              <Frontispiece plate={plate} />
            </div>

            <article class="surface" aria-labelledby="surface-repositories">
              <div class="surface__title">
                <p class="tag">Checkouts</p>
                <h3 id="surface-repositories" class="h3">Read the copy an agent is changing.</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="surface__ui">
          <figure class="window">
            <div class="app app--poster app--repo" role="img" aria-label="The Projects section of Astrolabe, on the billing repository, with the checkout of the thread Invoices pass exact totals picked. The sidebar lists its three uncommitted files, a row for its changes against main, and the files changed recently. The file totals.ts is open with line numbers. Its header says an agent is working in this checkout and that TypeScript is its language server, and a hover on total shows its signature.">
              <div class="tb">
                <div class="tb__cap">
                  <span class="lights" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
                  <svg class="ico"><use href="#i-panel" /></svg>
                  <span class="spacer"></span>
                  <svg class="ico ico--sm"><use href="#i-left" /></svg>
                  <svg class="ico ico--sm ico--faint"><use href="#i-right" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="tb__strip tb__strip--pane">
                  <span class="lights lights--crop" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
                  <span class="tab is-front is-focus"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><span class="tab__title">totals.ts</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-x" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="tab"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-diff" /></svg><span class="tab__title">Uncommitted changes</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-x" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="tab tab--narrow-off"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><span class="tab__title">round.ts</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-x" /></svg></span>
                  <svg class="ico ico--muted"><use href="#i-plus" /></svg>
                  <span class="spacer"></span>
                  <svg class="ico ico--muted"><use href="#i-more" /></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pb">
                <nav class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="rail__mark"><svg><use href="#b-monogram" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__item"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-msgs" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__item"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-book" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__item is-active"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-repo" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__item"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pr" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__item"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-usage" /></svg></span>
                  <span class="rail__fill"></span>
                  <span class="rail__item"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-settings" /></svg></span>
                </nav>
                <i class="pb__corner" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <aside class="side">
                  <div class="side__head">
                    <span class="side__title">Projects</span>
                    <span class="side__tools"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-search" /></svg><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-filter" /></svg><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-new" /></svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="checkout"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-branch" /></svg><span>Invoices pass exact totals · invoices-exact-totals</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-chevron" /></svg></div>
                  <ul class="side__list rlist">
                    <li class="rlink"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-repo" /></svg><span>Changes</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-right" /></svg></li>
                    <li class="rlabel">Uncommitted · 3</li>
                    <li class="rlink"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-diff" /></svg><span>Review uncommitted changes</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-right" /></svg></li>
                    <li class="rfile is-active"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>totals.ts</b><span>src/invoices</span><em>+14 −9</em></li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>line.ts</b><span>src/invoices</span><em>+3 −6</em></li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>totals.test.ts</b><span>src/invoices</span><em>+22 −2</em></li>
                    <li class="rlink"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-branch" /></svg><span>Changes against main</span><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-right" /></svg></li>
                    <li class="rlabel">Recently changed</li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>round.ts</b><span>src/ledger</span><em>2h</em></li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>ledger.ts</b><span>src/ledger</span><em>2h</em></li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>currency.ts</b><span>src/money</span><em>1d</em></li>
                    <li class="rfile"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-file" /></svg><b>retry.ts</b><span>src/webhooks</span><em>3d</em></li>
                  </ul>
                </aside>
                <div class="pane pane--file">
                  <div class="file__bar">
                    <code>src/invoices/totals.ts</code>
                    <span class="file__working"><svg class="ico ico--xs"><use href="#i-bot" /></svg>An agent is working in this checkout</span>
                    <span class="file__lsp">TypeScript</span>
                    <span class="file__saved">Saved</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="code">
                    <p><i>1</i><code>import &#123; ledger &#125; from <span class="syn-s">"../ledger/ledger"</span>;</code></p>
                    <p><i>2</i><code>import type &#123; Invoice &#125; from <span class="syn-s">"./invoice"</span>;</code></p>
                    <p><i>3</i><code></code></p>
                    <p><i>4</i><code><span class="syn-c">// Unrounded: the ledger rounds once.</span></code></p>
                    <p><i>5</i><code>export function <span class="syn-d file__hovered">total</span>(invoice: Invoice) &#123;</code></p>
                    <p><i>6</i><code>  let sum = <span class="syn-n">0</span>;</code></p>
                    <p><i>7</i><code>  for (const line of invoice.lines) &#123;</code></p>
                    <p><i>8</i><code>    sum += line.quantity * line.unitPrice;</code></p>
                    <p><i>9</i><code>  &#125;</code></p>
                    <p><i>10</i><code>  return sum;</code></p>
                    <p><i>11</i><code>&#125;</code></p>
                    <p><i>12</i><code></code></p>
                    <p><i>13</i><code>export function <span class="syn-d">post</span>(invoice: Invoice) &#123;</code></p>
                    <p><i>14</i><code>  return ledger.post(&#123;</code></p>
                    <p><i>15</i><code>    account: <span class="syn-s">"receivables"</span>,</code></p>
                    <p><i>16</i><code>    source: <span class="syn-s">`invoice:$&#123;invoice.id&#125;`</span>,</code></p>
                    <p><i>17</i><code>    amount: total(invoice),</code></p>
                    <p><i>18</i><code>  &#125;);</code></p>
                    <p><i>19</i><code>&#125;</code></p>
                    <div class="file__hover" aria-hidden="true">
                      <code>function total(invoice: Invoice): number</code>
                      <span>Unrounded: the ledger rounds once.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </figure>
              </div>
              <div class="surface__desc">
                <p>
                  A thread can work in a worktree of its own. Pick it, and the sidebar leads with what is
                  moving there: its uncommitted changes, its branch against main, then the files its latest
                  commits touched. It keeps up as agents change files on disk.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Edit a file and it saves a moment after you stop typing. It says when an agent is working
                  in the same copy, and your edit never overwrites newer changes saved there. Comment on a
                  line of a diff to send it to that agent’s thread.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Language servers for TypeScript, Python, Rust, Go and more show problems as you read, with
                  completions, go to definition, find references and rename. A file’s local graph draws what
                  it imports and what imports it.
                </p>
                <p class="surface__note">
                  On your iPhone, the Projects tab lists the same files, read only.
                </p>
                <a class="link" href="/download">Download Astrolabe<svg class="arw" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow" /></svg></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </section>
